# Commands

The app runs inside a Frappe **bench**. It cannot be run standalone.

## Setup
```sh
bench get-app https://github.com/Tacten/biograph
bench --site <site> install-app healthcare
```
CI does the full bench bootstrap with `.github/helper/install.sh`. That script clones frappe, then gets erpnext and payments on the same branch, falling back to `version-16` for fork branches.

## Tests (server)
```sh
cd ~/frappe-bench
bench --site test_site run-parallel-tests --app healthcare --total-builds 1 --build-number 1
# or a single doctype / module:
bench --site test_site run-tests --app healthcare --doctype "Patient Appointment"
```
The site needs `allow_tests`. See `.github/helper/site_config.json`.

## Lint and format
```sh
pip install pre-commit && pre-commit install
npm install   # eslint deps
pre-commit run --all-files
```
Pre-commit runs ruff (with `--fix`), ruff-format, prettier, eslint, pip-audit, detect-secrets, and the basic hooks: yaml/json/toml/ast/merge-conflict/debug-statements.

Semgrep:
```sh
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/frappe/semgrep-rules.git .frappe-semgrep-rules
semgrep ci --config ./.frappe-semgrep-rules/rules --config r/python.lang.correctness
```

## Patient portal
```sh
yarn build              # root: cd patient_portal && yarn build
cd patient_portal && yarn dev   # vite dev server proxying to bench
```

## Migrations
```sh
bench --site <site> migrate
```
This runs `patches.txt` and `after_migrate`.
